# Renfit Component Rules

Implements `frontend/rules/DESIGN.md` and `frontend/rules/README.md` as **React/Tailwind patterns**. Update rules here when DESIGN.md tokens change.

## Brand tokens (use exactly)

| Token | Tailwind / CSS |
|-------|----------------|
| Background | `bg-[#0B0B0B]` or `bg-black` for sidebars |
| Primary | `bg-[#0F6B3E]`, `text-[#0F6B3E]`, `border-[#0F6B3E]/30` |
| Glass surface | `bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm` or `backdrop-blur-xl` |
| Border | `border-white/10` |
| Text primary | `text-white` |
| Text secondary | `text-white/60` or `text-white/70` |
| Text tertiary | `text-white/40` |
| Hover glow | `hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(15,107,62,0.5)]` |

Fonts load via `frontend/src/styles/fonts.css` — rely on theme (`font-family` in `theme.css`); do not introduce fonts without Vietnamese diacritic support.

## Buttons

**Primary CTA** (pill + glow):

```tsx
<button className="px-8 py-4 bg-[#0F6B3E] hover:bg-[#0F6B3E]/90 text-white rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(15,107,62,0.5)]">
  Chat ngay với AI coach
</button>
```

**Secondary**:

```tsx
className="px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white rounded-full border border-white/20 transition-all duration-300"
```

- Use `rounded-full` for CTAs; `rounded-2xl`/`rounded-3xl` for panel actions.
- Green is for **primary actions**, active nav, progress, and AI badges — not large backgrounds or body text.

## Cards (glassmorphism — required)

```tsx
<div className="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-3xl p-8 border border-white/10 hover:border-[#0F6B3E]/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105">
```

- Minimum padding `p-6`–`p-8`; radius `rounded-3xl` (~24px).
- **Anti-pattern**: solid `bg-gray-900` / `bg-zinc-900` cards — breaks the system.

## Inputs and textareas

```tsx
className="w-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 text-white placeholder:text-white/40 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#0F6B3E] transition-colors leading-relaxed"
```

- Chat input areas: `rounded-3xl`, optional mic/image icon row below textarea.
- No `uppercase` on Vietnamese placeholders or labels.

## Layout

- **8px grid**: use Tailwind spacing scale (`p-4`, `gap-6`, `py-24`) — avoid arbitrary px unless matching a token.
- **Section**: `py-24 px-6` → `max-w-7xl mx-auto`.
- **Reading width**: `max-w-3xl mx-auto` for long AI replies.
- **Grids**: `grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3` mobile-first.

## Navigation and chrome

- **Landing**: `Navigation` sticky header; logo top-left.
- **AI Coach page** (`AIChatPage`): left sidebar `w-80 bg-black border-r border-white/10`; logo links to `/`; bottom CTA “Trở về trang chủ” — no dashboard/profile/login blocks unless auth is added.
- **Active nav item** (when used): `text-[#0F6B3E] bg-[#0F6B3E]/20 rounded-xl px-4 py-3`.
- **Inactive**: `text-white/70 hover:text-[#0F6B3E] hover:bg-white/5`.

## AI Coach UI (`AIChatPage`, `AIChat` section)

**Header**

```tsx
<div className="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0F6B3E] to-[#0F6B3E]/80 px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-3">
  <Bot /> Renfit AI Coach <span className="animate-pulse">Đang hoạt động</span>
</div>
```

**Messages**

- User: `bg-[#0F6B3E] text-white rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm`, align right.
- AI: `bg-white/10 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm`, align left; label “AI Coach” with `Bot` icon in `#0F6B3E`.
- Timestamps: `text-white/40 text-xs`.

**Action cards** (after AI text, max 3–4):

```tsx
<button className="bg-white/5 hover:bg-[#0F6B3E]/20 border border-white/10 hover:border-[#0F6B3E] rounded-xl p-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 text-left">
  <Icon className="w-6 h-6 text-[#0F6B3E] mb-2" />
  <div className="text-white text-sm font-medium">{title}</div>
  <div className="text-white/60 text-xs">{description}</div>
</button>
```

**Landing AI preview** (`AIChat.tsx`): show sample thread + single CTA linking to `/ai-coach` — not a fake sendable input.

**AI copy tone**: professional Vietnamese, “bạn”, ≤3 paragraphs, structured bullets, minimal emoji; include safety disclaimer for health topics.

## Decorative sections

- Animated blobs: `bg-[#0F6B3E]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse` on dark sections.
- Badge: `bg-[#0F6B3E]/20 border border-[#0F6B3E]/30` + `Sparkles` icon + “AI-Powered”.
- Hero: full viewport height optional; image with dark gradient overlay.

## Charts and data (dashboard)

- Bar/line primary color `#0F6B3E`; grid `rgba(255,255,255,0.1)`.
- Reuse `components/ui/chart.tsx` when adding real data.

## Checklist before shipping UI

- [ ] Background `#0B0B0B`, glass cards, emerald `#0F6B3E` CTAs
- [ ] Vietnamese strings, `leading-relaxed`, no uppercase Vietnamese
- [ ] Focus visible (green border/ring)
- [ ] `duration-300` transitions; hover scale on interactive containers only
- [ ] AI responses follow structure + safety rules in `api-guidelines.md`
